# Upstash Redis REST credentials (get from https://upstash.com -> your DB -> REST API)
# These are entered in the app's "⚙ 数据库设置" panel and stored in the browser.
# Shown here only as a reminder of the two values the app needs:
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL   e.g. https://your-db.upstash.io
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN e.g. Axp_xxxx
